    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.poster.avif?t=1749206138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.webm?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.mp4?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.poster.avif?t=1749206138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.webm?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.mp4?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 firearms and 6 melee weapons. A dynamic status effect system encourages creative weapon combinations and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/d000672e4d8c4cd5b12b441e519a2a75.poster.avif?t=1749206138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/d000672e4d8c4cd5b12b441e519a2a75.webm?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/d000672e4d8c4cd5b12b441e519a2a75.mp4?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gritty world where danger lurks in every shadow, and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of human nature in a decaying world. Your wayward brother wants a ride to retrieve an old stash \u2014 what could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.poster.avif?t=1749206138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.webm?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/4432f2be77457d8083db3673b2de699d.mp4?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.poster.avif?t=1749206138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.webm?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/3d535bc401a8c2f1901f2d09c713698e.mp4?t=1749206138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p cla